EXT. LAKEFRONT TRAIL, CHICAGO - SATURDAY, 7 A.M. #14#

Sunrise over Lake Michigan. Jamie and Nora jog past Ohio Street Beach with the Lakefront Run Club. Nora is carrying a loaf of sourdough, for some reason.

NARRATOR (V.O.)
Jamie found a room. And on Saturdays, a running buddy.

